      hu: ["Közvetlen szomszédságban van a Wetland Parkkal.", "Sűrű könnyűvasút-hálózattal rendelkezik.", "A Tin Shui Wai Parkról ismert.", "Hongkong egyik legfiatalabb városi területe."],
      ro: ["Situat în imediata apropiere a Wetland Park.", "Are o rețea densă de metrou ușor.", "Cunoscut pentru Parcul Tin Shui Wai.", "Una dintre cele mai noi zone urbane din HK."],
      en: ["Located in close proximity to the Wetland Park.", "Features a dense Light Rail Transit network.", "Known for the large Tin Shui Wai Park.", "One of the youngest urban areas in Hong Kong."],
